# CI UI only. Machine fields, arguments and remote run identities stay opaque.
ci-help = Observe GitHub Actions runs without changing remote state
ci-help-repo = Repository in [HOST/]OWNER/REPO format (defaults to the current repository)
ci-help-status = Query CI for the current HEAD or --commit once
ci-help-list = Query recent CI runs once
ci-help-watch = Watch one run until completion or timeout without rerunning it
ci-help-timeout = Maximum observation time in seconds
ci-help-interval = Observation interval in seconds
ci-help-json-lines = Print each observation as one JSON line
ci-help-commit = Full commit SHA (defaults to local HEAD for status)
ci-help-branch = Additionally filter by branch
ci-help-limit = Maximum runs to return (does not enumerate required checks)
ci-head-unavailable = Cannot resolve local HEAD. Specify a full SHA with --commit.
ci-head-encoding = git HEAD output is not UTF-8.
ci-watch-timeout = CI observation timed out. The remote run was not cancelled.
ci-empty = No matching CI runs. This does not mean CI passed.
ci-limit = Result limit reached. Older runs may exist.
ci-list-invalid = Cannot decode the gh CI list JSON.
ci-sha-mismatch = gh returned a CI run for a different commit.
ci-run-invalid = Cannot decode the gh CI run JSON.
ci-run-mismatch = gh returned a different run ID.
ci-invalid-sha = A full commit SHA (40 or 64 hexadecimal characters) is required.
ci-invalid-repo = Repository must use [HOST/]OWNER/REPO format.
ci-not-successful = CI run { $run } completed without success. Check its conclusion above.
ci-command-timeout = { $program } query timed out.
ci-program-missing = Cannot find { $program }. Check its installation and PATH.
ci-start-failed = Cannot start { $program }: { $error }
ci-command-failed = { $program } query failed ({ $status }): { $hint }
ci-hint-auth = Check GitHub authentication (`gh auth status`).
ci-hint-rate-limit = Check the GitHub API rate limit.
ci-hint-permission = Check GitHub Actions read access or API restrictions.
ci-hint-not-found = Check repository, run ID and read access. Private resources may return 404.
ci-hint-other = Check the repository, network and gh version. Raw error bodies are not printed.
